(5044711, 736416, 98141, '<td valign="top">I hope you were parked when you took this :P Has a very snap-shot feel. I would like it more if the whole mirror were included instead of being chopped off.</td>', 'I hope you were parked when you took this :P Has a very snap-shot feel. I would like it more if the whole mirror were included instead of being chopped off.', '2008-11-05 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
