(5044976, 736726, 98141, '<td valign="top">This feels like you ran around your apartment five minutes before the deadline, found a mirror, and took a snapshot. Doesn''t feel thought-out at all. Framing is awkward.</td>', 'This feels like you ran around your apartment five minutes before the deadline, found a mirror, and took a snapshot. Doesn''t feel thought-out at all. Framing is awkward.', '2008-11-05 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
