(5045774, 736274, 58272, '<td valign="top">The reflections are nicely captured and you''ve got some great contrast here. I think many people will enjoy seeing the photographer in the shot, though perhaps not for everyone.</td>', 'The reflections are nicely captured and you''ve got some great contrast here. I think many people will enjoy seeing the photographer in the shot, though perhaps not for everyone.', '2008-11-05 07:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045779, 736460, 58272, '<td valign="top">Niceley set up and executed. The sharp edges and colour contrast work well and the composition is great.</td>', 'Niceley set up and executed. The sharp edges and colour contrast work well and the composition is great.', '2008-11-05 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045780, 736737, 58272, '<td valign="top">I like the emotional aspect captured here. The b&amp;w process helps this along. I think I might have prefered the frame to be in focus here.</td>', 'I like the emotional aspect captured here. The b&w process helps this along. I think I might have prefered the frame to be in focus here.', '2008-11-05 07:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045782, 736691, 19670, '<td valign="top">Not sure the "mirror is evident in your photograph" as the challenge stated...but a good portrait with a nice contrast of color and black &amp; white.</td>', 'Not sure the "mirror is evident in your photograph" as the challenge stated...but a good portrait with a nice contrast of color and black & white.', '2008-11-05 07:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045790, 736580, 58272, '<td valign="top">I''m not aure about the angle here, or perhaps that the mirror isn''t standing quite upright enough, it looks slightly awkward is all. I''d like to see this cropped in quite close as I think you could create something quite surreal.</td>', 'I''m not aure about the angle here, or perhaps that the mirror isn''t standing quite upright enough, it looks slightly awkward is all. I''d like to see this cropped in quite close as I think you could create something quite surreal.', '2008-11-05 07:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045795, 736434, 58272, '<td valign="top">I like that you''ve aimed at capturing mirrors without reflections. The DOF adds interest and I like the toned back colours, though I think you could have also pushed it the other way by making that colours stronger.</td>', 'I like that you''ve aimed at capturing mirrors without reflections. The DOF adds interest and I like the toned back colours, though I think you could have also pushed it the other way by making that colours stronger.', '2008-11-05 07:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5045797, 734872, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, and nice sense of drama (or anticipated drama).</td>', 'Nice DOF, and nice sense of drama (or anticipated drama).', '2008-11-05 07:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
