(5046406, 736493, 94601, '<td valign="top">I love the idea!!! Seeing the sky, bright vibrant colors in contrast to the fallen leaves is great.  I wish the mirrored leaves were just a bit more in focus- needs a bigger depth of field.  Great concept.</td>', 'I love the idea!!! Seeing the sky, bright vibrant colors in contrast to the fallen leaves is great.  I wish the mirrored leaves were just a bit more in focus- needs a bigger depth of field.  Great concept.', '2008-11-05 12:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046411, 736713, 94601, '<td valign="top">1) That is a great looking dog.<br/> <br/>2) This is a really well captured and balanced photo. I think the framing is great, the reflection is subtle but adds quite a bit, and the way you focused on the eye is phenomenal.  I''ve only voted on a few so far, but this is an early favorite for me!</td>', '1) That is a great looking dog. 2) This is a really well captured and balanced photo. I think the framing is great, the reflection is subtle but adds quite a bit, and the way you focused on the eye is phenomenal.  I''ve only voted on a few so far, but this is an early favorite for me!', '2008-11-05 12:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046420, 736692, 94601, '<td valign="top">I would love to see a picture of this taken without the mirror.  (Even though I know the challenge is mirrors).  Personally, I think that the mirror takes away from how breathtaking this picture can be... I know you needed to use a mirror to meet the challenge, but it looks like a great picture, well composed, with great color, with a mirror added in the end- which takes away from the image IMO.<br/> <br/>Did you take a picture of this without the mirror?  I hope so!</td>', 'I would love to see a picture of this taken without the mirror.  (Even though I know the challenge is mirrors).  Personally, I think that the mirror takes away from how breathtaking this picture can be... I know you needed to use a mirror to meet the challenge, but it looks like a great picture, well composed, with great color, with a mirror added in the end- which takes away from the image IMO. Did you take a picture of this without the mirror?  I hope so!', '2008-11-05 12:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046427, 735260, 94601, '<td valign="top">I think with this title, it would have been great to see some children in the mirror or somewhere in the shot... a child with a little red backpack or something.  Personally, I might have taken a little bit of a tighter crop on the mirror, there''s quite a bit of dead space all around the mirror that (to me) doesn''t add a lot.  Great idea, well exposed, and great colors though. =o)</td>', 'I think with this title, it would have been great to see some children in the mirror or somewhere in the shot... a child with a little red backpack or something.  Personally, I might have taken a little bit of a tighter crop on the mirror, there''s quite a bit of dead space all around the mirror that (to me) doesn''t add a lot.  Great idea, well exposed, and great colors though. =o)', '2008-11-05 12:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046429, 736244, 83313, '<td valign="top">The secondary reflections (glass surface + underlying mirror layer) looks a bit odd at this angle, and I find the cropping a little too tight for my preference.</td>', 'The secondary reflections (glass surface + underlying mirror layer) looks a bit odd at this angle, and I find the cropping a little too tight for my preference.', '2008-11-05 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046430, 736465, 94601, '<td valign="top">The background in the mirror washes out the subject (and the reflection) a little bit.  I think if you flipped the backgrounds, this could be a great shot... white behind the mirror and a dark background in the reflection.  It might give a little more definition of the subject.  Nice idea though.</td>', 'The background in the mirror washes out the subject (and the reflection) a little bit.  I think if you flipped the backgrounds, this could be a great shot... white behind the mirror and a dark background in the reflection.  It might give a little more definition of the subject.  Nice idea though.', '2008-11-05 12:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046434, 736468, 94601, '<td valign="top">Love it.  The bend in the reflection creates a great effect that contrasts a ''normal'' cityscape.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Love it.  The bend in the reflection creates a great effect that contrasts a ''normal'' cityscape.  Very nicely done.', '2008-11-05 12:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046438, 736635, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and well done for the most part. Something about it made me check the file size, though. You could have probably used less compression and gotten a bit more detail into this. Your file size is 101k and you had 150k to play with. For a very detailed subject like this barn, you should utilize all the file size you can.</td>', 'Nice concept and well done for the most part. Something about it made me check the file size, though. You could have probably used less compression and gotten a bit more detail into this. Your file size is 101k and you had 150k to play with. For a very detailed subject like this barn, you should utilize all the file size you can.', '2008-11-05 12:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046440, 736298, 94601, '<td valign="top">NICE! Great juxtaposition, and really creative.  The shape of the candles (especially the way the work in the mirror is great).  I''d love to see a full reflection without the basket blocking the reflection of the bases of the candles.  Other than that, great shot!</td>', 'NICE! Great juxtaposition, and really creative.  The shape of the candles (especially the way the work in the mirror is great).  I''d love to see a full reflection without the basket blocking the reflection of the bases of the candles.  Other than that, great shot!', '2008-11-05 12:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046443, 736314, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the autumn leaves.  I think there''s too much car body in this shot- although with the title, I understand why you wanted some of it in the shot.  But the color of the leaves are great and I want to see more of that, but the car blocks it. I hope you took some pictures of the leaves without the mirror/car because it looks like a great scene!</td>', 'Nice shot of the autumn leaves.  I think there''s too much car body in this shot- although with the title, I understand why you wanted some of it in the shot.  But the color of the leaves are great and I want to see more of that, but the car blocks it. I hope you took some pictures of the leaves without the mirror/car because it looks like a great scene!', '2008-11-05 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046448, 736463, 94601, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  My only complaint would be the color- I''d love to either see a bit more saturation to make the beak pop out, or no saturation to make it black and white (since it''s almost black and white already- it may pop more without the soft color from the beak).  Very nice shot though.</td>', 'Very nice.  My only complaint would be the color- I''d love to either see a bit more saturation to make the beak pop out, or no saturation to make it black and white (since it''s almost black and white already- it may pop more without the soft color from the beak).  Very nice shot though.', '2008-11-05 12:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046454, 736416, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha... cute.  It''s a great shot in the mirror, but I''m left wanting for what''s seen through the front windshield- it''s a bit distracting.  It would have been nice to have a really pretty landscape, or sunset in the front... then could give extra weight to how much more precious the view in the rearview is.</td>', 'haha... cute.  It''s a great shot in the mirror, but I''m left wanting for what''s seen through the front windshield- it''s a bit distracting.  It would have been nice to have a really pretty landscape, or sunset in the front... then could give extra weight to how much more precious the view in the rearview is.', '2008-11-05 12:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046459, 736530, 94601, '<td valign="top">very interesting. did you swing the mirror and then take the shot with the feather falling?  I think it could have been neat to see a little distance between the feather and the mirror, but that''s just me wondering.  GREAT shot.</td>', 'very interesting. did you swing the mirror and then take the shot with the feather falling?  I think it could have been neat to see a little distance between the feather and the mirror, but that''s just me wondering.  GREAT shot.', '2008-11-05 12:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046461, 735719, 83313, '<td valign="top">This could benefit from some levels, curves and saturation adjustments. Just out of curiosity, I copied and pasted this shot into PaintShop Pro and those quick adjustments made a huge difference in this pic. Those adjustments also brought out a lot of compression artifacts around the window frames. Your file size is only 49k. You could have used a lot less compression and that would have helped as well. Compression kills detail. Always use as much of the available file size as you can. (150k for a basic challenge)<br/> <br/>Composition is a little odd as well. I can see some effort to try and get an interesting viewpoint, however.</td>', 'This could benefit from some levels, curves and saturation adjustments. Just out of curiosity, I copied and pasted this shot into PaintShop Pro and those quick adjustments made a huge difference in this pic. Those adjustments also brought out a lot of compression artifacts around the window frames. Your file size is only 49k. You could have used a lot less compression and that would have helped as well. Compression kills detail. Always use as much of the available file size as you can. (150k for a basic challenge) Composition is a little odd as well. I can see some effort to try and get an interesting viewpoint, however.', '2008-11-05 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046462, 735719, 94601, '<td valign="top">very cool shot.  I would personally rotate it 90 degrees (when I turn my laptop sideways, I LOVE THIS SHOT- makes the crane look taller instead of longer).  Well done.</td>', 'very cool shot.  I would personally rotate it 90 degrees (when I turn my laptop sideways, I LOVE THIS SHOT- makes the crane look taller instead of longer).  Well done.', '2008-11-05 12:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046463, 735738, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the theme. I wonder how hard it was to get her lined up like this, and if it is a person or a painting I am seeing?</td>', 'Interesting use of the theme. I wonder how hard it was to get her lined up like this, and if it is a person or a painting I am seeing?', '2008-11-05 13:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046464, 736460, 94601, '<td valign="top">Love the title. Great shot too.  You should smile next time! haha.</td>', 'Love the title. Great shot too.  You should smile next time! haha.', '2008-11-05 13:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046467, 736707, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice fall colors. A good effort, though nothing really grabs me about it.</td>', 'Nice fall colors. A good effort, though nothing really grabs me about it.', '2008-11-05 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046468, 736482, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice. Colors are fantastic- I think the extra saturation makes it look like a painting. I like it!</td>', 'Nice. Colors are fantastic- I think the extra saturation makes it look like a painting. I like it!', '2008-11-05 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046480, 735930, 94601, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Interesting.  At first view I wasn''t a fan, but the more I look at it the more I''m intrigued by it- looking at the eyes, and understanding the reflection.  It''s nice! I think a little crop off the top could do a lot- I know the space defines the door, but seeing the door and frame takes away from my eyes being drawn to the man.  Well done.</td>', 'Hmm. Interesting.  At first view I wasn''t a fan, but the more I look at it the more I''m intrigued by it- looking at the eyes, and understanding the reflection.  It''s nice! I think a little crop off the top could do a lot- I know the space defines the door, but seeing the door and frame takes away from my eyes being drawn to the man.  Well done.', '2008-11-05 13:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046488, 734845, 94601, '<td valign="top">the contast, and soft focus make this picture look like an animation to me.  Great contrast for a B&amp;W.  nice shot... but just no ''wow'' factor for me.</td>', 'the contast, and soft focus make this picture look like an animation to me.  Great contrast for a B&W.  nice shot... but just no ''wow'' factor for me.', '2008-11-05 13:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046490, 736673, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this comes off as a casual snapshot in the mirror. I copied and pasted this into my editor to see if some simple adjustments could help. Tried levels, curves and a saturation bump, and it helped some, but not enough, I''m afraid. There''s just not much in the frame to grab ones attention, I think.</td>', 'I''m afraid this comes off as a casual snapshot in the mirror. I copied and pasted this into my editor to see if some simple adjustments could help. Tried levels, curves and a saturation bump, and it helped some, but not enough, I''m afraid. There''s just not much in the frame to grab ones attention, I think.', '2008-11-05 13:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046493, 735968, 94601, '<td valign="top">Would be nice with a deeper DOF so the lipstick is in focus in the mirror.  It''s always nice if the reflection is sharp, especially in a close up shot of an item</td>', 'Would be nice with a deeper DOF so the lipstick is in focus in the mirror.  It''s always nice if the reflection is sharp, especially in a close up shot of an item', '2008-11-05 13:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046496, 735033, 94601, '<td valign="top">What face?! haha.  Very nice.  I love the shallow DOF here...  out of focus in the foreground and sharp in the mirror. Black background works well with the reflected white background.... gives a nice contrast. well done.</td>', 'What face?! haha.  Very nice.  I love the shallow DOF here...  out of focus in the foreground and sharp in the mirror. Black background works well with the reflected white background.... gives a nice contrast. well done.', '2008-11-05 13:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046498, 736459, 94601, '<td valign="top">I LOVE this photo.  Conceptually great and execution even better.  It''s fantastic. First 10 of the day from me- and with this as the standard, it will be hard to give another one.</td>', 'I LOVE this photo.  Conceptually great and execution even better.  It''s fantastic. First 10 of the day from me- and with this as the standard, it will be hard to give another one.', '2008-11-05 13:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046503, 735564, 94601, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  I love the multiple level reflections- with a far reflection in the foreground, and a more pano. shot in the back. Very nice!</td>', 'Awesome.  I love the multiple level reflections- with a far reflection in the foreground, and a more pano. shot in the back. Very nice!', '2008-11-05 13:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046504, 736678, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice isolation. Incredibly creative. No complaints here at all.</td>', 'Nice isolation. Incredibly creative. No complaints here at all.', '2008-11-05 13:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046510, 734982, 94601, '<td valign="top">Looks like a gang fight is about to break out... haha.  I love the colors and how sharp it is. Very nice.</td>', 'Looks like a gang fight is about to break out... haha.  I love the colors and how sharp it is. Very nice.', '2008-11-05 13:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046513, 736434, 94601, '<td valign="top">I''m normally a huge fan of shallow DOF, but for some reason, the way this shot is composed, I want to see this whole image sharp. Nice picture though...  what is this a picture of?</td>', 'I''m normally a huge fan of shallow DOF, but for some reason, the way this shot is composed, I want to see this whole image sharp. Nice picture though...  what is this a picture of?', '2008-11-05 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046514, 736669, 94601, '<td valign="top">simple and very nice.</td>', 'simple and very nice.', '2008-11-05 13:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046520, 735260, 83313, '<td valign="top">A simple idea that others have also entered variations of, but this one is well executed. Very clean, crisp and bold. Maybe a little too centered for me.</td>', 'A simple idea that others have also entered variations of, but this one is well executed. Very clean, crisp and bold. Maybe a little too centered for me.', '2008-11-05 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046526, 734982, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not about to back down from the bully is he?</td>', 'Not about to back down from the bully is he?', '2008-11-05 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046533, 736244, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha. nice. have you ever seen "what the duck"? It''s a cartoon about photographers.  Nice picture- I think the keychain is a big distracting and takes away from the overall effect. Nice shot though.</td>', 'haha. nice. have you ever seen "what the duck"? It''s a cartoon about photographers.  Nice picture- I think the keychain is a big distracting and takes away from the overall effect. Nice shot though.', '2008-11-05 13:16:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046537, 735062, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gee, thanks, now I''ll have the Bee Gees stuck in my head for the rest of the afternoon!<br/> <br/>The photo itself is only ok, I''m afraid. I think perhaps a different angle, or some adjustments to bring out the reflected colors may have helped.</td>', 'Gee, thanks, now I''ll have the Bee Gees stuck in my head for the rest of the afternoon! The photo itself is only ok, I''m afraid. I think perhaps a different angle, or some adjustments to bring out the reflected colors may have helped.', '2008-11-05 13:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046540, 736635, 94601, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  The only thing that I would want is just a little more balance (level/brightness wise) in the shot. I''d love to see a bit more definition in the building (not too much, so that the sunset in the mirror still pops like it does) but just so that it doesn''t appear to be too dark/underexposed. Very nice.</td>', 'Awesome.  The only thing that I would want is just a little more balance (level/brightness wise) in the shot. I''d love to see a bit more definition in the building (not too much, so that the sunset in the mirror still pops like it does) but just so that it doesn''t appear to be too dark/underexposed. Very nice.', '2008-11-05 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046552, 736179, 94601, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  The definition in the lock is great and the reflection is nice.  Background is a bit distracting (and so are the little spots on the mirror)- but overall nice!</td>', 'Very nice.  The definition in the lock is great and the reflection is nice.  Background is a bit distracting (and so are the little spots on the mirror)- but overall nice!', '2008-11-05 13:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046553, 735761, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice perspective view, and those great swoopy clouds that tend to go with lots of high scoring shots. Seems a little soft or flat, somehow. I think some easy editing adjustments could bump this up quite a bit.</td>', 'A nice perspective view, and those great swoopy clouds that tend to go with lots of high scoring shots. Seems a little soft or flat, somehow. I think some easy editing adjustments could bump this up quite a bit.', '2008-11-05 13:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046575, 736433, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what to make of this. I''ve been looking at it for a few minutes and I''m not sure if it is understated creativity, or just an odd view.</td>', 'Not sure what to make of this. I''ve been looking at it for a few minutes and I''m not sure if it is understated creativity, or just an odd view.', '2008-11-05 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046576, 736394, 94601, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great picture that is well done.  Not sure if it meets the "basic editing rules"<br/> <br/>"you may: saturate, desaturate or change the colors of your entry, but no selections are allowed."<br/> <br/>But I know some cameras have selective color captures- is that what you used?<br/> <br/>Either way- well done.</td>', 'I think this is a great picture that is well done.  Not sure if it meets the "basic editing rules" "you may: saturate, desaturate or change the colors of your entry, but no selections are allowed." But I know some cameras have selective color captures- is that what you used? Either way- well done.', '2008-11-05 13:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046577, 736356, 94601, '<td valign="top">nice. I love how the wall and face are so sharp, but the back of the head and background in the mirror are blurred.  Gives great depth. Nice.</td>', 'nice. I love how the wall and face are so sharp, but the back of the head and background in the mirror are blurred.  Gives great depth. Nice.', '2008-11-05 13:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046579, 736712, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a few other automobile mirrors in this challenge already, but this one made me look twice. It appeared to be a single scene with a black shadow across it, until I looked closer.</td>', 'I''ve seen a few other automobile mirrors in this challenge already, but this one made me look twice. It appeared to be a single scene with a black shadow across it, until I looked closer.', '2008-11-05 13:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046581, 736440, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha... i''m assuming 5 because of the challenge.  Nice- love the contrast and the really shallow DOF.</td>', 'haha... i''m assuming 5 because of the challenge.  Nice- love the contrast and the really shallow DOF.', '2008-11-05 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046582, 736582, 94601, '<td valign="top">nice- love the definition in the flower and the great blue background.</td>', 'nice- love the definition in the flower and the great blue background.', '2008-11-05 13:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046585, 736349, 94601, '<td valign="top">there''s a few shots like this in the challenge, but this one has to be one of my favorites so far.  Great subject, nice quazi-silhouette- well done.</td>', 'there''s a few shots like this in the challenge, but this one has to be one of my favorites so far.  Great subject, nice quazi-silhouette- well done.', '2008-11-05 13:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046587, 736737, 94601, '<td valign="top">a little too much in the foreground- it''s a little distracting in my opinion.  great concept though.</td>', 'a little too much in the foreground- it''s a little distracting in my opinion.  great concept though.', '2008-11-05 13:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046590, 736580, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha. love the title.  fantastic blues and definition on the bird''s feathers.  very nice.</td>', 'haha. love the title.  fantastic blues and definition on the bird''s feathers.  very nice.', '2008-11-05 13:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046596, 736179, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice gleaming metal tones. The sepia works well here.</td>', 'Nice gleaming metal tones. The sepia works well here.', '2008-11-05 13:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046597, 736611, 94601, '<td valign="top">i love it.  I''m predicting ribbon!!!!  I think the 360 degree reflection is fantastic, with the fallen leaves all around. Great color, and balance.  My only concern is the shadow in the front, but I didn''t even notice it until I looked at it a 4th of 5th time. Great shot.</td>', 'i love it.  I''m predicting ribbon!!!!  I think the 360 degree reflection is fantastic, with the fallen leaves all around. Great color, and balance.  My only concern is the shadow in the front, but I didn''t even notice it until I looked at it a 4th of 5th time. Great shot.', '2008-11-05 13:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046600, 735062, 94601, '<td valign="top">sorry, hard photo to look at for me.  There''s not a lot in focus, and if there disco ball is in focus, there''s nothing reflecting in it for a viewer''s eyes to focus on. good concept, but leaves me wanting a bit more.</td>', 'sorry, hard photo to look at for me.  There''s not a lot in focus, and if there disco ball is in focus, there''s nothing reflecting in it for a viewer''s eyes to focus on. good concept, but leaves me wanting a bit more.', '2008-11-05 13:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046603, 736434, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is almost certainly in reality, a bright red. I think your saturation really needs to come up, and different lighting or a different angle might have helped as well.</td>', 'This is almost certainly in reality, a bright red. I think your saturation really needs to come up, and different lighting or a different angle might have helped as well.', '2008-11-05 13:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5046622, 735197, 96626, '<td valign="top">D''instindt, on dirait : dommage ! Sol très beau, grain magnifique et technique clairement maîtrisée, mais ces carrés blancs si violents heurtent notre regarde, nous aveugle nous perde... beaucoup trop lumineux, et si l''idée était de représenter une fenêtre se découpant sur le sol par un jeu de lumière, il y a une rangée de trop, et ce carré casse l''effet de deux rangées seules qui auraient incité notre regard à aller vers l''arrière de la photo... si le seul intéret était la géométrie des formes, alors la construction photographique peut sembler pauvre... cet avis n''engage bien sur que moi, mais cet émoi vient du fait qu''on sent que la photo aurait pu être superbe... dommage !<br/>Néanmoins bon courage pour la suite, en espérant voir un jour d''autres de vos photos de cette ambiance !</td>', 'D''instindt, on dirait : dommage ! Sol très beau, grain magnifique et technique clairement maîtrisée, mais ces carrés blancs si violents heurtent notre regarde, nous aveugle nous perde... beaucoup trop lumineux, et si l''idée était de représenter une fenêtre se découpant sur le sol par un jeu de lumière, il y a une rangée de trop, et ce carré casse l''effet de deux rangées seules qui auraient incité notre regard à aller vers l''arrière de la photo... si le seul intéret était la géométrie des formes, alors la construction photographique peut sembler pauvre... cet avis n''engage bien sur que moi, mais cet émoi vient du fait qu''on sent que la photo aurait pu être superbe... dommage !Néanmoins bon courage pour la suite, en espérant voir un jour d''autres de vos photos de cette ambiance !', '2008-11-05 13:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
