(5047403, 736099, 73564, '<td valign="top">Great image quality, nice colors and comp.9</td>', 'Great image quality, nice colors and comp.9', '2008-11-05 18:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047405, 736106, 73564, '<td valign="top">I had an idea like this, but never got around to entering, I like how the mirror looks totally dif from the rest, good one, 10.</td>', 'I had an idea like this, but never got around to entering, I like how the mirror looks totally dif from the rest, good one, 10.', '2008-11-05 18:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047412, 736272, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice and contrasty. Lots of mono "oomph" here, though It''s not grabbing me at all. Not sure why.</td>', 'Nice and contrasty. Lots of mono "oomph" here, though It''s not grabbing me at all. Not sure why.', '2008-11-05 18:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047419, 735930, 83313, '<td valign="top">This photo struck me as soft, and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 46k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one)<br/> <br/>The composition of the bust in the frame is also a problem. It leads my eye out of the picture, rather than into it. The man in the mirror does not seem like anything other than that he happened to be there when you took the shot.</td>', 'This photo struck me as soft, and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 46k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (150k for this one) The composition of the bust in the frame is also a problem. It leads my eye out of the picture, rather than into it. The man in the mirror does not seem like anything other than that he happened to be there when you took the shot.', '2008-11-05 19:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047424, 736298, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice concept, though I think the shot itself is coming off to me more like a high ISO snapshot. There is a fair amount of ISO grain hurting the smooth appearance of the candle holders. Perhaps a lower ISO and longer shutter speed could help with that, though I won''t know your shot settings until after the challenge.</td>', 'A nice concept, though I think the shot itself is coming off to me more like a high ISO snapshot. There is a fair amount of ISO grain hurting the smooth appearance of the candle holders. Perhaps a lower ISO and longer shutter speed could help with that, though I won''t know your shot settings until after the challenge.', '2008-11-05 19:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047431, 736493, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I''m not sure what to make of this. It is asking the question of why a mirror is on the forest floor like this. I don''t think it''s really working for me.</td>', 'Interesting. I''m not sure what to make of this. It is asking the question of why a mirror is on the forest floor like this. I don''t think it''s really working for me.', '2008-11-05 19:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047432, 736171, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice clean shot, thought I think the lighting could have been better. It just seems a to me that the plants don''t stand out against the background much.</td>', 'A nice clean shot, thought I think the lighting could have been better. It just seems a to me that the plants don''t stand out against the background much.', '2008-11-05 19:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047434, 735154, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this comes off as a snapshot to me. I do see some good effort at composition. The overall comp and leading lines of the wires take my eye up to the striped mirror, where I see,... a cut off scene. Sorry to come off so harsh on this.</td>', 'I''m afraid this comes off as a snapshot to me. I do see some good effort at composition. The overall comp and leading lines of the wires take my eye up to the striped mirror, where I see,... a cut off scene. Sorry to come off so harsh on this.', '2008-11-05 19:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047438, 736644, 83313, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting rear view mirror entries. Using the mirror to frame this was a good idea. It''s an interesting looking building, and doing a night scene adds contrast and interest to the scene.</td>', 'One of the more interesting rear view mirror entries. Using the mirror to frame this was a good idea. It''s an interesting looking building, and doing a night scene adds contrast and interest to the scene.', '2008-11-05 19:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047442, 735361, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like bugs. Very cool looking. How did you get it to sit like that? Is it dead, or are you one of those folks who refrigerates bugs to make them hold still for photos?</td>', 'I like bugs. Very cool looking. How did you get it to sit like that? Is it dead, or are you one of those folks who refrigerates bugs to make them hold still for photos?', '2008-11-05 19:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047445, 736349, 99256, '<td valign="top">Love this picture.  I hope it does very well.</td>', 'Love this picture.  I hope it does very well.', '2008-11-05 19:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047453, 736424, 99256, '<td valign="top">What a sweet looking fella.</td>', 'What a sweet looking fella.', '2008-11-05 19:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047457, 735726, 99256, '<td valign="top">It looks pretty grainy.  Grain isn''t always bad but in this case I think its kinda distracting.</td>', 'It looks pretty grainy.  Grain isn''t always bad but in this case I think its kinda distracting.', '2008-11-05 19:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047483, 735738, 98141, '<td valign="top">I find this image eerie and a little confusing. A little dark. It''s hard for me to tell what I''m really looking at, and I don''t think the mirror is very evident. Great antique colors.</td>', 'I find this image eerie and a little confusing. A little dark. It''s hard for me to tell what I''m really looking at, and I don''t think the mirror is very evident. Great antique colors.', '2008-11-05 19:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047484, 736283, 100161, '<td valign="top">great colors! not sure where to look though.</td>', 'great colors! not sure where to look though.', '2008-11-05 19:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047485, 736353, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this! You used the mirror in a different way than I''ve seen so far, definitely fits the challenge but not in an overstated kind of way. I like the b&amp;w in this.</td>', 'I like this! You used the mirror in a different way than I''ve seen so far, definitely fits the challenge but not in an overstated kind of way. I like the b&w in this.', '2008-11-05 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047486, 735755, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a cutie - I like the composition, good positioning of the subject. I think I''d like if the colors were a little more saturated?</td>', 'What a cutie - I like the composition, good positioning of the subject. I think I''d like if the colors were a little more saturated?', '2008-11-05 19:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047489, 736465, 98141, '<td valign="top">Tan in the upper right corner is distracting... Strange photo but interesting to look at.</td>', 'Tan in the upper right corner is distracting... Strange photo but interesting to look at.', '2008-11-05 19:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047491, 736665, 100161, '<td valign="top">might benefit from a reframing... off center?  and it''s out of focus.</td>', 'might benefit from a reframing... off center?  and it''s out of focus.', '2008-11-05 19:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047492, 736277, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Would love to see it in color, after will you post the original or something? Nice framing on the right using her hair.</td>', 'Interesting photo. Would love to see it in color, after will you post the original or something? Nice framing on the right using her hair.', '2008-11-05 19:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047493, 736438, 98141, '<td valign="top">This made my mind bend when I first looked at it! Very eye-catching, lovely colors.</td>', 'This made my mind bend when I first looked at it! Very eye-catching, lovely colors.', '2008-11-05 19:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047497, 736488, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.', '2008-11-05 20:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047498, 736635, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. If the mirror were parallel to the vertical slats of wood rather than the base (horizontal) wood, I think it would blend in even better. I don''t really care for the angle of the pic, but perhaps it was necessary in order to achieve that trick with the mirror? The glare that lands in the black space at the top is distracting, hard to get rid of in basic though.</td>', 'Very cool idea. If the mirror were parallel to the vertical slats of wood rather than the base (horizontal) wood, I think it would blend in even better. I don''t really care for the angle of the pic, but perhaps it was necessary in order to achieve that trick with the mirror? The glare that lands in the black space at the top is distracting, hard to get rid of in basic though.', '2008-11-05 20:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047499, 736611, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great shot, cute title. Love the even covering of leaves.</td>', 'Great shot, cute title. Love the even covering of leaves.', '2008-11-05 20:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047501, 736434, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro, nice focus. Would like it even better with more vivid colors, this seems a little dull to me.</td>', 'Interesting macro, nice focus. Would like it even better with more vivid colors, this seems a little dull to me.', '2008-11-05 20:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047503, 736368, 98141, '<td valign="top">I saw another one very similar to this: I like the dual mirrors. The extreme brightness of the candle draws your eye to that a lot, perhaps limit the exposure a little?</td>', 'I saw another one very similar to this: I like the dual mirrors. The extreme brightness of the candle draws your eye to that a lot, perhaps limit the exposure a little?', '2008-11-05 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047505, 735559, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think you will get a bit of grief for this not being a "mirror," but in my mind it counts I think this is a lovely picture, would love to see it posted in color after :)</td>', 'I think you will get a bit of grief for this not being a "mirror," but in my mind it counts I think this is a lovely picture, would love to see it posted in color after :)', '2008-11-05 20:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047509, 736607, 98141, '<td valign="top">Good focus, something very "old money" about the tones. I''ve seen a lot of women putting on makeup in this challenge, though.</td>', 'Good focus, something very "old money" about the tones. I''ve seen a lot of women putting on makeup in this challenge, though.', '2008-11-05 20:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047511, 736691, 98141, '<td valign="top">Is this his reflection or him? Trying to figure out the answer to that question is part of the fun of looking at this pic. Love the colors, the black background.</td>', 'Is this his reflection or him? Trying to figure out the answer to that question is part of the fun of looking at this pic. Love the colors, the black background.', '2008-11-05 20:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047515, 736078, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great use of colors, how do you do that in basic?</td>', 'Great use of colors, how do you do that in basic?', '2008-11-05 20:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047516, 736180, 98141, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, nice focus.</td>', 'Clever idea, nice focus.', '2008-11-05 20:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047518, 736404, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fun self-portrait :)</td>', 'Fun self-portrait :)', '2008-11-05 20:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047522, 736415, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the break in the mirror, you risked 7 years of bad luck for this challenge! You''re braver than me, so you get a bonus point ;) I would like to see a greater difference between the focus in the front and the oof girl, I think having her almost in focus takes away from the impact a bit.</td>', 'I like the break in the mirror, you risked 7 years of bad luck for this challenge! You''re braver than me, so you get a bonus point ;) I would like to see a greater difference between the focus in the front and the oof girl, I think having her almost in focus takes away from the impact a bit.', '2008-11-05 20:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047525, 736468, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like this, it feels a bit grainy but I love the lines and the fullness of the frame with details.</td>', 'I like this, it feels a bit grainy but I love the lines and the fullness of the frame with details.', '2008-11-05 20:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047526, 736440, 98141, '<td valign="top">Cool. Reminds me of Beauty and the Beast when the silverware is walking around and singing.</td>', 'Cool. Reminds me of Beauty and the Beast when the silverware is walking around and singing.', '2008-11-05 20:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047529, 736692, 98141, '<td valign="top">Definitely uses a mirror, but this lacks any wow factor to me. I would like it more if a little more of the background behind the mirror were in the fram, would emphasize your focus more.</td>', 'Definitely uses a mirror, but this lacks any wow factor to me. I would like it more if a little more of the background behind the mirror were in the fram, would emphasize your focus more.', '2008-11-05 20:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047530, 736678, 98141, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Great job framing the reflection. A little bit dark in the very front.</td>', 'Interesting. Great job framing the reflection. A little bit dark in the very front.', '2008-11-05 20:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047533, 736433, 98141, '<td valign="top">How many mirrors did you have to use to set this up? Seems tricky. Not sure the impact is there though. The composition is a little awkward. Would like it better if there was black on the right as well.</td>', 'How many mirrors did you have to use to set this up? Seems tricky. Not sure the impact is there though. The composition is a little awkward. Would like it better if there was black on the right as well.', '2008-11-05 20:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047539, 736741, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great antique-ish colors. Would like to see it with the whole moth included. I do like how each reflection shows something different. Actually, the more I look at the more I like it. Disregard everything I just said :)</td>', 'Great antique-ish colors. Would like to see it with the whole moth included. I do like how each reflection shows something different. Actually, the more I look at the more I like it. Disregard everything I just said :)', '2008-11-05 20:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047544, 736285, 60698, '<td valign="top">Brilliant! Very beautifully photographed</td>', 'Brilliant! Very beautifully photographed', '2008-11-05 20:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047549, 736611, 60698, '<td valign="top">Love it! This has to win a ribbon! :)</td>', 'Love it! This has to win a ribbon! :)', '2008-11-05 20:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047566, 735696, 60698, '<td valign="top">Verrry creative! Love it!</td>', 'Verrry creative! Love it!', '2008-11-05 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047572, 736368, 76598, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I am not sure of the execution</td>', 'Good idea, I am not sure of the execution', '2008-11-05 20:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047597, 736737, 63218, '<td valign="top">This did not surrender to my first glance, I like that.</td>', 'This did not surrender to my first glance, I like that.', '2008-11-05 20:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047622, 735559, 83544, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry if i''m not too open minded for this photo. Water creates reflection but water it''s not a mirror. Anyway the photo looks good</td>', 'I''m sorry if i''m not too open minded for this photo. Water creates reflection but water it''s not a mirror. Anyway the photo looks good', '2008-11-05 20:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047632, 736243, 83544, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but your light source (I guess the mirror on the lest) is too much distracting and it''s obsolite in the picture beacause you already have a reflection from another object at the bottom.</td>', 'Interesting idea but your light source (I guess the mirror on the lest) is too much distracting and it''s obsolite in the picture beacause you already have a reflection from another object at the bottom.', '2008-11-05 20:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5047635, 735579, 83544, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say this again but I''m not too open minded for this contest. If they wanted a mirror give them a mirror. Water reflects things but it''s not a mirror.</td>', 'Sorry to say this again but I''m not too open minded for this contest. If they wanted a mirror give them a mirror. Water reflects things but it''s not a mirror.', '2008-11-05 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
