(5049632, 736665, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lighting would be better with a fill light so that the shadow wasn''t behind the mirror. Cool mirror. So much space above it and yet the bottom is cut off, I would prefer it if the bottom wasn''t cut off. You did a nice job of keeping the reflective surface black.</td>', 'Lighting would be better with a fill light so that the shadow wasn''t behind the mirror. Cool mirror. So much space above it and yet the bottom is cut off, I would prefer it if the bottom wasn''t cut off. You did a nice job of keeping the reflective surface black.', '2008-11-06 21:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
