(5051440, 736673, 31776, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I find this quite boring. There is no subject to focus on, the blurriness on thr right of the picture is distracting and the colours are bland. Would have been a nice idea but maybe I''m a little jaded after looking at so many other rear view mirrors.</td>', 'Sorry but I find this quite boring. There is no subject to focus on, the blurriness on thr right of the picture is distracting and the colours are bland. Would have been a nice idea but maybe I''m a little jaded after looking at so many other rear view mirrors.', '2008-11-07 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051483, 735085, 13390, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great perspective, contrast, and clarity. I honestly can''t think of a way to improve the shot. Nicely done.</td>', 'Beautiful! Great perspective, contrast, and clarity. I honestly can''t think of a way to improve the shot. Nicely done.', '2008-11-07 20:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051484, 736513, 13390, '<td valign="top">I like this one (maybe because I am a sucker for Sepia tone). Love the composition and can''t think of much you could do to improve it. Good luck!</td>', 'I like this one (maybe because I am a sucker for Sepia tone). Love the composition and can''t think of much you could do to improve it. Good luck!', '2008-11-07 20:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051499, 736673, 13390, '<td valign="top">Shots like this you need to be a little careful with. I liked how you showed the edge of the mirror to show that it is a car mirror. The focus is not quite there though. Correct exposure, but it''s hard because there is nothing really grabbing the viewer. There also seems to be a bit of pixelation from cropping? Keep shooting!</td>', 'Shots like this you need to be a little careful with. I liked how you showed the edge of the mirror to show that it is a car mirror. The focus is not quite there though. Correct exposure, but it''s hard because there is nothing really grabbing the viewer. There also seems to be a bit of pixelation from cropping? Keep shooting!', '2008-11-07 20:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051571, 736459, 13390, '<td valign="top">Cool perspective. You may not have gotten a lot of this but I actually enjoy the little bit of noise in this shot, gives it more character. The border was distracting for me on this one. Happy shooting and good luck!</td>', 'Cool perspective. You may not have gotten a lot of this but I actually enjoy the little bit of noise in this shot, gives it more character. The border was distracting for me on this one. Happy shooting and good luck!', '2008-11-07 21:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051574, 736460, 13390, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, I really like it. The only thing is that the background grass and dirt seems to try to compete for attention, though I do like the green mixed with the blue. Anyhow, I like it and good luck!</td>', 'Cool shot, I really like it. The only thing is that the background grass and dirt seems to try to compete for attention, though I do like the green mixed with the blue. Anyhow, I like it and good luck!', '2008-11-07 21:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051575, 736440, 13390, '<td valign="top">If there''s a mirror there then that is one clean mirror! Great DOF. The crop to me seems a bit tight and and a bit high. Other than that I like it. Good luck!</td>', 'If there''s a mirror there then that is one clean mirror! Great DOF. The crop to me seems a bit tight and and a bit high. Other than that I like it. Good luck!', '2008-11-07 21:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051578, 736272, 13390, '<td valign="top">That is one clean mirror.I like the 3 composition and the lighting, the black and white in color is pretty neat.</td>', 'That is one clean mirror.I like the 3 composition and the lighting, the black and white in color is pretty neat.', '2008-11-07 21:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051583, 734792, 13390, '<td valign="top">I probably wouldn''t have noticed the white van if it weren''t for the title. There is a lot going on in the picture which makes it hard for the eye to settle on something. The shot is technically sound though, great exposure and clarity. Good luck and happy shooting!</td>', 'I probably wouldn''t have noticed the white van if it weren''t for the title. There is a lot going on in the picture which makes it hard for the eye to settle on something. The shot is technically sound though, great exposure and clarity. Good luck and happy shooting!', '2008-11-07 21:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051739, 736298, 13390, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat little setup, I like how the green candle lines up right to have the flame in the mirror. What''s difficult here is the lightning. It looked like your camera picked a higher sensitivity or ISO due to less available light, that''s where all the chroma and luminance noise come from giving it that more snapshotish look. Try have one strong, dominant light source, you''d be amazed at the difference it can make. Hope that helps!</td>', 'It''s a neat little setup, I like how the green candle lines up right to have the flame in the mirror. What''s difficult here is the lightning. It looked like your camera picked a higher sensitivity or ISO due to less available light, that''s where all the chroma and luminance noise come from giving it that more snapshotish look. Try have one strong, dominant light source, you''d be amazed at the difference it can make. Hope that helps!', '2008-11-07 23:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051746, 736171, 13390, '<td valign="top">At first it was hard to tell there was a mirror. It''s a good shot, but seems there seems to be something that really pulls the viewer in. Technically sound shot overall. Maybe higher dynamic range could have helped with a variance of lights and darks created by a single, strong light source.</td>', 'At first it was hard to tell there was a mirror. It''s a good shot, but seems there seems to be something that really pulls the viewer in. Technically sound shot overall. Maybe higher dynamic range could have helped with a variance of lights and darks created by a single, strong light source.', '2008-11-07 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5051749, 735696, 72670, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this without the camera.</td>', 'I think I would have liked this without the camera.', '2008-11-07 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
