(5052827, 736438, 94601, '<td valign="top">THAT IS GREAT!!!  I really like the concept and the execution.  The way the mirror reflects is great, giving pieces of the face, not never the eyes- leaves it all very mysterious.  Well done.</td>', 'THAT IS GREAT!!!  I really like the concept and the execution.  The way the mirror reflects is great, giving pieces of the face, not never the eyes- leaves it all very mysterious.  Well done.', '2008-11-08 18:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5052828, 736671, 94601, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I''d love to see something a bit more in focus in the shot, but I have no where to focus when I''m looking at the shot.   I think the concept is a great use of mirrors.</td>', 'Interesting.  I''d love to see something a bit more in focus in the shot, but I have no where to focus when I''m looking at the shot.   I think the concept is a great use of mirrors.', '2008-11-08 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5052829, 736260, 94601, '<td valign="top">Well executed with a great title to finish the whole product off.  Very creative use of mirrors.</td>', 'Well executed with a great title to finish the whole product off.  Very creative use of mirrors.', '2008-11-08 18:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5052833, 736180, 94601, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Reflection is great, and the focus on the glasses/face is great, but I wish there was more to see in the reflection.  The tents give a nice contrast to the sky/background, but there is nothing to focus on at all.  If there was, I think this could be a fantastic shot.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Reflection is great, and the focus on the glasses/face is great, but I wish there was more to see in the reflection.  The tents give a nice contrast to the sky/background, but there is nothing to focus on at all.  If there was, I think this could be a fantastic shot.', '2008-11-08 18:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5052835, 736400, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like this, especially after looking at a lot of other shots, because the mirror is used, but not forced into the picture.  There isn''t a lot in the reflection though- it does help give some depth to the shot, but a little repositioning to give some more defined images of the hand.  Overall, pretty nice.</td>', 'Nice.  I like this, especially after looking at a lot of other shots, because the mirror is used, but not forced into the picture.  There isn''t a lot in the reflection though- it does help give some depth to the shot, but a little repositioning to give some more defined images of the hand.  Overall, pretty nice.', '2008-11-08 18:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5052840, 736361, 94601, '<td valign="top">very creative with the angles.  They eye contact is great in the handheld.  The coloring is a bit weird to me, not quite wb right.  Well composed and thought out shot though.</td>', 'very creative with the angles.  They eye contact is great in the handheld.  The coloring is a bit weird to me, not quite wb right.  Well composed and thought out shot though.', '2008-11-08 18:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
