(5058234, 736695, 67697, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why but this kind of made me think of the movie "The Shining".  I think it''s like there''s some intense person ready to bust out of the mirror.  And the colortone and slight grain give it that throw-back feel.</td>', 'I don''t know why but this kind of made me think of the movie "The Shining".  I think it''s like there''s some intense person ready to bust out of the mirror.  And the colortone and slight grain give it that throw-back feel.', '2008-11-11 23:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
