(5058465, 736678, 48228, '<td valign="top">I actually thought the same Irene, but gee, it is really so very good, and so deserved the ribbon..... Well done Jennifer, and another <b>''BLUE''</b> to add to your fine collection..... shez<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by IreneM:</b></div><hr/><i> When I first saw this I thought it was another Coley masterpiece. Now I see it''s another Jennifer masterpiece! GREAT shot, very creative. Huge cngrats on your blue ribbon, Jennifer. </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-12 00:49:58.</i></td>', 'I actually thought the same Irene, but gee, it is really so very good, and so deserved the ribbon..... Well done Jennifer, and another ''BLUE'' to add to your fine collection..... shez Originally posted by IreneM: When I first saw this I thought it was another Coley masterpiece. Now I see it''s another Jennifer masterpiece! GREAT shot, very creative. Huge cngrats on your blue ribbon, Jennifer. ', '2008-11-12 00:47:13.000000', '2008-11-12 00:49:58.000000', 0),
