(5165175, 736594, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do not get the score on this one at all - perfect for the challenge and you''ve managed to create a complete make-believe world with those watery stairs in the reflection, in front of which sits a most regal and gorgeous real cat!  I can almost believe there are two cats here.  Very cool shot!</td>', 'I do not get the score on this one at all - perfect for the challenge and you''ve managed to create a complete make-believe world with those watery stairs in the reflection, in front of which sits a most regal and gorgeous real cat!  I can almost believe there are two cats here.  Very cool shot!', '2009-01-02 13:08:34.000000', NULL, 0);
